  Rederive new axioms ax-4, ax-10, ax-6, ax-12, ax-13 from old
=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=

  Theorems ~ ax12fromc15 and ~ ax13fromc9 require some intermediate theorems
