  $( The setvar ` x ` is not free in ` A. x ph ` .  Example in Appendix in
     [Megill] p. 450 (p. 19 of the preprint).  Also Lemma 22 of [Monk2] p. 114.
     (Contributed by NM, 24-Jan-1993.)  (Proof modification is discouraged.)
