    LBGNKBKMABGHIJ $.

  ${
    axc4i-o.1 $e |- ( A. x ph -> ps ) $.
    $( Inference version of ~ ax-c4 .  (Contributed by NM, 3-Jan-1993.)
       (Proof modification is discouraged.)  (New usage is discouraged.) $)
    axc4i-o $p |- ( A. x ph -> A. x ps ) $=
      ( wal hba1-o alrimih ) ACEBCACFDG $.
