     (New usage is discouraged.) $)
  aecom-o $p |- ( A. x x = y -> A. y y = x ) $=
    ( weq wal ax-c11 pm2.43i equcomi1 alimi syl ) ABCZADZJBDZBACZBDKLJABEFJMBAB
    GHI $.

