      EEEHTIVAZXCVBWTABEEVCVDVEVFVGVH $.

    $d x y .< $.  $d x y z X $.  $d x y z Y $.
    $( Binary relation expressing ` B ` covers ` A ` , which means that ` B `
       is larger than ` A ` and there is nothing in between.  Definition 3.2.18
       of [PtakPulmannova] p. 68.  ( ~ cvbr analog.)  (Contributed by NM,
       18-Sep-2011.) $)
    cvrval $p |- ( ( K e. A /\ X e. B /\ Y e. B ) -> ( X C Y <->
               ( X .< Y /\ -. E. z e. B ( X .< z /\ z .< Y ) ) ) ) $=
      ( vx vy wcel w3a wbr cv wa wrex wn copab wb cvrfval 3anass opabbii eqtrdi
